   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-0aa97327-a739-4665-a077-bc11d656c994 coh-component-instance-0aa97327-a739-4665-a077-bc11d656c994 accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_2" aria-expanded="true"> 2027 Contribution Rates </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_2" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-1fbbb7c1-aa60-470b-bf7c-4b171299b33c coh-component-instance-1fbbb7c1-aa60-470b-bf7c-4b171299b33c">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p>Due to rising healthcare costs, contributions will increase slightly for 2027. Your 2027 biweekly contributions are shown below with a side-by-side comparison of all three medical plans. To calculate the weekly contribution amount, divide the biweekly contribution by two. We are happy to share that there will be no changes to <a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/health/dental-vision">dental or vision</a> costs. All other <a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/health/additional-health-insurance-benefits">health and insurance benefits</a> will not be changing. <a href="https://fwc.widen.net/content/3lwfg3apt6/pdf/Eaton-AE-Decision-Guide.pdf?u=uwe64u">Click here</a> to view the 2027 Benefits Enrollment Decision Guide.</p><p>Your medical plan contribution rate will vary depending on:</p><ul><li>The medical plan and coverage level you select</li><li>Your annual base pay</li><li>Your Healthy Incentive credits earned</li></ul><p>Review the tables below to see bi-weekly medical contribution rates in 2027. The first table shows rates for a participant with no Healthy Incentive credits. The second table shows a participant with full credits.</p> </div> </div> 
