            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-60103875-3a4d-4111-af56-602b48d3e0c9 coh-component-instance-60103875-3a4d-4111-af56-602b48d3e0c9 accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_3" aria-expanded="true"> Healthy Incentives </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_3" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-0758662d-ee8b-492b-a734-678c91e8cc08 coh-component-instance-0758662d-ee8b-492b-a734-678c91e8cc08">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p>Keep more money in your paycheck by completing your <a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/healthy-incentives">Healthy Incentives</a>. You can earn up to $1,800 towards your medical plan contributions, putting more money in your pocket at the end of the day. Receive rewards for living healthier! <a href="https://fwc.widen.net/content/vf8ti159jn/pdf/Healthy-Incentives-Final.pdf?u=uwe64u" target="_blank">Click here</a> for the 2027 Healthy Incentives Newsletter. New for 2027 Annual Enrollment, you can confirm if youâ€™re Tobacco Free in NetBenefits. Know Your Numbers must still be completed through Optum Engage. (You can answer the Tobacco Free User question there too). Also, for the first time, NetBenefits will now show your 2027 contribution amount based on your answer to the Tobacco Free User question and if you have completed Know Your Numbers by October 9, 2026. If you have not completed Know Your Numbers by October 9th you will see a higher contribution amount. You still have until November 10th to earn your full Healthy Incentives credit. NetBenefits will be updated after Annual Enrollment closes to reflect anyone who completes their Healthy Incentives by the November 10th deadline.</p><p><a href="https://eaton.rallyengage.com/___.YzJ1OmVhdG9uY2hlY2twb2ludGhhcm1vbnk6YzpvOjQ3YWQ1YTUzYzNlMjk4NWJiYWEwNGRkZmNjYjUwODNhOjc6MWY0NTplNjRkMDc5ZWUzZWU2NWEyZDE0YzNhOWNjZmIxYjc3OGM0MzZiNjMzMjJjMDJlMWM3NDg4NGY2Y2ZhY2RmNTEyOnA6RjpG">Click here</a> to visit Optum Engage to complete your activities and earn valuable medical plan contribution credits for 2027! You must complete all actions by the end of the year to receive these credits. If you complete the actions by December 31, youâ€™ll receive credits starting March 1 of the following year.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-9295f3c2-3cfe-4d22-82c6-2d9bb9d3b92a coh-component-instance-9295f3c2-3cfe-4d22-82c6-2d9bb9d3b92a accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_4" aria-expanded="true"> Purchase Additional Vacation Days </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_4" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-49fcf473-9ed5-4491-a4d2-451c23a377de coh-component-instance-49fcf473-9ed5-4491-a4d2-451c23a377de">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p>Are you planning a life-changing trip around a milestone event? Need some extra R&amp;R this coming year? Annual Enrollment is the time to purchase additional vacation days for 2027. Eaton understands that time away from work is essential for the health of its employees. Work/life balance can look different for everyone, which is why we offer up to one work week of additional vacation time for purchase.&nbsp;</p><p>You are eligible to participate in the Purchased Vacation Program if you work at least 20 hours per week. New hires are not eligible for this benefit in the first year. You <strong>must</strong> elect to participate in the Vacation Purchase Program each year. Visit the Employee Center for more information.&nbsp;</p><p><em>Note: If you are represented by a recognized collective bargaining agent, you are eligible for Purchased Vacation Program only if stated in the collective bargaining agreement.</em></p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-807df4bd-2ffd-47ad-9061-00aa46632abc coh-component-instance-807df4bd-2ffd-47ad-9061-00aa46632abc accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_5" aria-expanded="true"> Donâ€™t Forget About Your Voluntary Benefits  </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_5" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-9f3e246e-7448-46f0-8d5b-9e08060c6780 coh-component-instance-9f3e246e-7448-46f0-8d5b-9e08060c6780">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p>You have access to voluntary benefits.</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="eaea73d6f8a2f7026f74817ce07226b07">Accident, Critical Illness and Hospital Indemnity Insurance may help you pay for unexpected costs resulting from an accident, serious illness or hospital stay.</li><li data-list-item-id="eb77bff974f95cedface9b1c103cbac22">The MetLife Legal Plan provides convenient and cost-effective access to a large network of attorneys available to help with plannedâ€”and unplannedâ€”personal legal matters.</li><li data-list-item-id="eb48efc68542ad350630b8ad7aefdcb4f">There are other optional insurance coverages available to you, including home, auto, pet, identity theft, and long-term care insurance.</li></ul><p><a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/health/additional-health-insurance-benefits">Click here</a> to learn more about your voluntary benefits options!</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
          <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-1eb8d335-ab8e-4463-85b2-72b2171e1ddd coh-component-instance-1eb8d335-ab8e-4463-85b2-72b2171e1ddd coh-style-content-template-viewport">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <h2><br>Coming in 2027! Two new programs to help meet your wellbeing needs!</h2> </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-b01f7c06-c409-49b9-9086-47c30998b80e coh-component-instance-b01f7c06-c409-49b9-9086-47c30998b80e accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_6" aria-expanded="true"> Better Surgical Support Powered by Lantern  </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_6" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-3797a685-54d7-48f9-a7f6-f6f6d7394a52 coh-component-instance-3797a685-54d7-48f9-a7f6-f6f6d7394a52">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p style="clear:both;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:0;margin-top:16px;"><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:-15px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/lantern.png" width="60" height="60" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="e3b4d2af-7867-4973-82a2-74167101c507" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loaded" data-was-processed="true">Lantern helps you find the best care when you need it most. By connecting you with a Network of Excellence made up of the nation's top specialists for surgery, Lantern delivers excellent care with significant savings for you and your family. You'll also get a dedicated care team, including Care Advocates, with you for your entire care journey, helping you get back to good health, back to your family and back to work. With specialists available nationwide, quality care is within driving distance for most. More than 6 million people across the country trust Lantern for their care. Learn more at <a href="https://lanterncare.com/member-eaton" target="_blank">lanterncare.com/member-eaton</a> or call <strong>855-524-4947</strong>.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-697281ab-464b-4136-a747-84fcd6911688 coh-component-instance-697281ab-464b-4136-a747-84fcd6911688 accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_7" aria-expanded="true"> Free Virtual Physical Therapy Powered by Hinge Health  </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_7" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-3b610741-c74c-4506-b2f4-ce018b5473bb coh-component-instance-3b610741-c74c-4506-b2f4-ce018b5473bb">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/hinge2_1.png" width="80" height="40" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="9246abbd-2cb4-4c03-a9bc-0103c1ad1239" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loaded" data-was-processed="true"> Hinge Health gives employees access to virtual physical therapy and more, at $0 cost to you. The program includes a licensed physical therapist and care team who builds you a personalized exercise program you can do in about 15 minutes a day. You also get access to real-time form guidance right from the app so you know you're doing the exercises correctly every time. Beyond muscle and joint pain, your program includes injury recovery, and pelvic floor therapy. Learn more and join the waitlist today by visiting <a href="https://www.hingehealth.com/for/eaton/?template_id=clientlandingpage&amp;template_name=landingpageurl&amp;utm_medium=digitalpackage&amp;utm_source=client&amp;utm_content=landingpage&amp;utm_campaign=bob&amp;mailformat=clientlandingpage&amp;sequence=0" target="_blank">hinge.health/eaton</a>.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
          <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-64ec84f6-f3eb-4a2f-83a0-d58b0b41b33d coh-component-instance-64ec84f6-f3eb-4a2f-83a0-d58b0b41b33d coh-style-content-template-viewport">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <h2><br>Explore More Eaton Benefits</h2> </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-f44cf72f-2054-42b6-b714-4aefc87f1a13 coh-component-instance-f44cf72f-2054-42b6-b714-4aefc87f1a13 accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_8" aria-expanded="true"> Physical Wellbeing </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_8" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-6d658353-278b-4958-905b-7b8f534f9d91 coh-component-instance-6d658353-278b-4958-905b-7b8f534f9d91">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/surest.png" width="100" height="40" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="aa71ef17-b747-4b99-8360-8634b10e8713" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loaded" data-was-processed="true"> <strong>MyChoice Plan (powered by Surest)</strong></p><p>Powered by Surest, the MyChoice plan offers lower monthly contributions than the Enhanced plan. Your comprehensive coverage begins on day one with no annual deductible and no coinsurance, and youâ€™ll be able to check online to find the total cost of your care and copays before heading to your provider. Visit <a href="https://britehr.app/Eaton/1?wgl=en" target="_blank">Surest.care/eaton</a> to preview costs for services at your current providers and search for services you may need in the future. Shop for the procedure, compare options and costs, then choose what's right for you and your family. As a reminder, providers who are higher quality and more efficient will have lower copays.</p><p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/vida.png" width="100" height="40" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="5b3da335-1af6-4d25-9138-e41656447fe2" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loaded" data-was-processed="true"><strong>Weight and Chronic Condition Management Program Powered by Vida</strong></p><p><strong>What is Vida Health?</strong></p><p>Vida is a virtual health program with a focus on mind and body wellness, weight loss, and health condition management.</p><p>When you sign up with Vida, youâ€™ll share your health goals and preferences. Vida will use that information to tailor a program to your needs, and youâ€™ll pick a coach to support you along the way. Your program will include helpful resources like videos, lessons, recipes, and more, plus easy progress tracking. Youâ€™ll also be able to connect your fitness trackers or health devices (see most common list in â€œ3rd-Party Devices and Appsâ€ below).</p><p><strong>Who is eligible for Vida through Eaton?</strong></p><p>All employees and their dependents aged 18+ enrolled in an active Eaton medical plan are eligible for Vida Health at no charge.</p><p><strong>What kind of health coaching can I receive through Vida?</strong></p><p>At Vida, we handpick the best coaches and health experts from across the country. Our coaches and providers can help you reach your personal goals. Here are a few examples of things we can help with:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="eed9819b02330c4fb94d5b7731581d8e4">Weight loss</li><li data-list-item-id="e817f245f00f6c577bed38d4ebcd1a903">Nutrition, including support for specialized diets (gluten-free, paleo, vegan, keto, and more)</li><li data-list-item-id="e463a82e84cd90e3d52b7ae77c3642f89">Exercise and strength training</li><li data-list-item-id="ee33ae9ec3e3efd40656a55392e4b02ee">Coping with stress</li><li data-list-item-id="e851aadd792ccf37f65866412a0a4636b">Improving sleep</li><li data-list-item-id="eefb9e5d65315398f8cc700335222770e">Managing type 1 diabetes, blood pressure, or cholesterol</li><li data-list-item-id="e0ee19c10d752450545e238f93bc24e67">Tackling pre-diabetes or other risk factors so they don't lead to chronic disease</li></ul><p>Sign up for Vida at <a href="https://www.vida.com/Eaton" target="_blank">www.vida.com/Eaton</a> or call 833-732-2242.</p><p><a href="https://fwc.widen.net/s/gvdsktp9mt/eaton-corporation-_open_enrollment_flyer_oe_2026---no-logo" target="_blank">Click here</a> for more information or <a href="https://fast.wistia.net/jrgjidnkwfrjdA6Dv5cC6Dj___.YzJ1OmVhdG9uY2hlY2twb2ludGhhcm1vbnk6YzpvZmZpY2UzNjVfZW1haWxzX2F0dGFjaG1lbnQ6ZDhjYmVmZjBiZGUxYzU4MjBjODRjNjFjOTE1NzNkNWI6NzpkNzY5OjIwNGM1ZjhhY2Q2MjAwNjNkMDZlZDkzNTI3NjVlOGIxOGQwM2Q4NGE0YTc2ODE0ZTI0NGIxMTU0NDI4MzY3ZTg6cDpGOlQ" target="_blank">click here</a> to watch a short video overview.</p><p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/level2.png" width="100" height="30" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="d53db3f2-bde2-47d8-a70b-280c63febba6" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loading" data-was-processed="true"><strong>Type Two Diabetes Management Powered by Level2</strong></p><p><strong>Level2 Diabetes Management</strong> is designed to help type two diabetics better manage their condition using Continuous Glucose Monitors (CGMs) and integrated virtual clinical support. Every member that enrolls in Level2 receives a free Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM) and personalized treatment plans with support from their virtual care team via the Level2 App. Visit <a href="https://mylevel2.com/our-approach-2/?utm_source=redirect&amp;utm_medium=care" target="_blank">mylevel2.com/care</a> or call 844-302-2821 to enroll. <a href="https://fwc.widen.net/s/wsqlhbc2dr/avp-flyer-level2" target="_blank">Click here</a> for additional information.</p><p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/color-word-logo.png" width="100" height="40" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="781a3de6-3fae-4885-ba92-3e9089ef041d" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loading" data-was-processed="true"><strong>Cancer Screenings Powered by Color</strong></p><p><strong>Color</strong> for cancer screenings. Keeping up with your cancer screenings is a criticalâ€”and provenâ€”way to catch cancer earlier. In our commitment to health and prevention, Eaton has partnered with <strong>Color</strong> to support you with an easier way to coordinate and manage cancer screenings. Get free at-home cancer screening kits, easy access to in-person services like mammograms and colonoscopies, private genetic testing, and support from a team of cancer experts with Color. <a href="https://join.color.com/eaton/" target="_blank">Click here</a> for additional information.</p><p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/onepass.png" width="100" height="40" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="01a9db5f-d36f-410e-af30-04a7bfbd8052" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loading" data-was-processed="true"><strong>Gym Memberships Powered by One Pass Select</strong></p><p>With Eatonâ€™s fitness program, One Pass Selectâ„¢, there are flexible fitness options for all. Choose a membership tier that fits your lifestyle and provides everything you need for whole-body health. Home grocery delivery makes it even more convenient to become a healthier you.*</p><p>Work out at home, whenever itâ€™s convenient for you, or select from thousands of fitness locations for strength training, yoga, swimming, spin classes and more.*<br><a href="https://www.onepassselect.com/?cid=eiIoptumImemberIemailIMarIemailIbuttonIEaton%20launch%20emailIIIenrollmentI45358I" target="_blank">Click here</a> to learn more and enroll today!</p><p>*Included with Classic and above.</p><p><img style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:10px;margin-top:3px;vertical-align:bottom;" src="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/sites/g/files/djuvja4121/files/maven-logo.png" width="100" height="30" data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="93ccb095-58d1-434f-9c81-50e37dfa559d" alt="" loading="lazy" data-once="lazyload-once" class="coh-lazy-loading" data-was-processed="true"><strong>Family Building, Maternity, Womenâ€™s Health and More Powered by Maven</strong></p><p>Whether youâ€™re looking for support with Family Building, Maternity &amp; Newborn Care, or Menopause support, Maven can help. Maven provides free, 24/7 personalized support for all medical plan-enrolled employees and their covered spouses/partners and dependentsâ€”including unlimited education, coaching, and support from experienced Optum fertility nurses.</p><p>Download the Maven app or visit <a href="https://www.mavenclinic.com/join/fs-maven" target="_blank">mavenclinic.com/join/fs-maven</a> to join today.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-d455791b-f20f-43c2-91d9-13fb42bd386c coh-component-instance-d455791b-f20f-43c2-91d9-13fb42bd386c accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_9" aria-expanded="true"> Financial Wellbeing </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_9" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-d43327de-fd2b-4937-bfab-539ace1af8c5 coh-component-instance-d43327de-fd2b-4937-bfab-539ace1af8c5">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p><strong>Financial Wellness Resources through Fidelity NetBenefits</strong></p><p>Are you thinking about buying a new home or car, or need to save for the unexpected? Do you want to tackle your student debt? Schedule time with a Fidelity Workplace Financial Consultant for a complimentary one-on-one session. <a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/wellbeing/financial-wellbeing">Click here</a> to learn more about the many financial wellness resources available to you.</p><p><strong>Eaton 401(k) Plan</strong></p><p>Annual Enrollment is a great time to check in on your 401(k) Plan. Eaton will match your contributions 50 cents on the dollar up to 6% of eligible pay you contribute (before-tax, Roth and/or after-tax). So, consider contributing at least 6% to the Eaton Savings Plan (ESP) to get the full company match. When you make your 2027 elections in NetBenefits, review your 401(k) contributions and ensure your beneficiaries are up to date. Visit the <a href="https://www.youreatonbenefits.com/retirement">retirement page</a> for information about the ESPP.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-7b0ac31d-203b-45d1-abad-2e0ed7cfdf20 coh-component-instance-7b0ac31d-203b-45d1-abad-2e0ed7cfdf20 accordion-item"> <h4 class="coh-heading accordion-header coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-562634c6 active" href="accordion_10" aria-expanded="true"> Emotional Wellbeing </h4>  <div class="coh-container accordion-content coh-ce-cpt_accordion_item-a5ffab98" id="accordion_10" style="display: block;">            <div class="coh-container ssa-component coh-component ssa-component-instance-153f2084-a3a0-4eef-a96f-4ddde8d842ef coh-component-instance-153f2084-a3a0-4eef-a96f-4ddde8d842ef">  <div class="coh-wysiwyg">    <p><strong>Mental Health Support</strong></p><p>For everything from anxiety to financial or relationship concerns and much more, as an Eaton employee, you have access to resources and tools that can help support your emotional and mental wellbeing. The Calm Health app is the newest resource available to support your mental wellbeing. <a href="https://fwc.widen.net/s/5ctjqtchfl/eaton-calm-health-flyer" target="_blank">Click here</a> to learn more about Calm Health.</p><p>Not sure which of the below mental health resources is best for you? Call a UnitedHealthcare Health Advisor for assistance with connecting you to the right program(s) â€“ 1-844-391-1889 or visit Optum Engage.</p><p><strong>Backup Care Powered by Care.com</strong></p><p>Care.comâ€™s family care benefits are here to support you as youâ€™re trying to manage it all while caring for those you love, including yourself. Eaton offers a Care.com membership, which includes the ability to post jobs and search and reach out to local caregivers 24/7. Search for care for children, adults, or pets, or find services such as housekeeping, tutors, and more. Also included is access to Care.comâ€™s Backup Care services, which is vetted and subsidized adult care and childcare when your regular care is not available. Note that summer camp is not reimbursable. Visit <a href="https://www.care.com/app/ent-enrollment/member-enrollment/welcome?groupName=Eaton+Corporation" target="_blank">eaton.care.com</a> to learn more.</p> </div> </div> 
   </div> </div> 
